# Variadic param collects excess positional args into a Dict.
# The variadic param type is set to Any in type inference (typecheck.rs:1480):
# grammar forbids @annotation on variadic params, so param_types[i] and the
# env binding are both set to Any for consistency.
# At runtime, excess positional args are collected into an int-keyed Dict.
[f: [fn [x ...rest] rest]
 result: [f 10 20 30]]
=== out
Dict({"f": Function(x, rest), "result": Dict({0: Int(20), 1: Int(30)})})
